<mxfile host="generated"><diagram name="Read me" id="d0"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="r0" value="&lt;b&gt;ProductName: every flow, who does what, where, and in what order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;One page per flow. Columns are who or where. Time runs top to bottom.&lt;br&gt;White boxes are built. Yellow boxes are in a GitHub issue. Red boxes are gaps with no issue yet (none left).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Set up a PC and share a folder&lt;br&gt;2. Open files on the same Wi-Fi&lt;br&gt;3. Make an account and sign in to the app&lt;br&gt;4. Add a PC to an account&lt;br&gt;5. Open files over the internet&lt;br&gt;6. Invite someone to a PC, and join with a code&lt;br&gt;7. Remove someone, or leave a PC&lt;br&gt;8. Take a PC off an account&lt;br&gt;9. Forgot the password, or the session ended&lt;br&gt;10. Update the app and the PC program&lt;br&gt;11. Delete an account&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Also in the tracker, not a flow of their own:&lt;/b&gt; #48 security review, #131 code signing, #151 mDNS by multicast, #173 hosting the server." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="900" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Gaps" id="d1"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="g0" value="&lt;b&gt;Found by walking every flow, filed on 2026-09-28&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table border='1' cellpadding='6' style='border-collapse:collapse'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Issue&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Title&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Flow&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Why the flow needs it&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#185&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;agent: open the settings page when the install finishes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;On macOS and Windows the only way in today is a terminal, until #159 and #160, which are P2. A person who is not technical stops here. #159 and #160 were raised to P1 at the same time.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#186&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;website: the approve page links to sign up and password reset, and comes back&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;A new person who starts on the PC meets a sign-in form with no way to make an account or reset a password.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#187&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;client: an invitation message that works for someone new&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The shared text says &amp;#x27;Sign in at &amp;lt;server&amp;gt; in the app&amp;#x27;. With the server built in (#175), it should link to the download page instead. Small; could go into #175.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#188&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;a guest leaves a PC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Only an admin can remove access. A guest cannot take a PC off their own list. Needs a server endpoint and a button.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#189&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;remove a PC you no longer have from the account&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Signing out needs the PC itself. &amp;#x27;Disable&amp;#x27; cannot be undone and the PC still shows. Uninstalling the agent leaves it on the account.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#190&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;agent: say when a newer version is out, and keep everything on upgrade&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The settings page shows no version. Nobody has checked that installing over an old agent keeps its key, shares and account.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;#184&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;client: show a PC that speaks another version as &amp;#x27;Needs an update&amp;#x27;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2, 10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The app drops a PC whose protocol version differs, with no message (Device.kt). After an update one side goes quiet and the person cannot tell why.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;Smaller, fold into an existing issue: Home's empty state links to the download page for the PC side (#174)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="1 Set up a PC and share a folder" id="d2"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p0t" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Set up a PC and share a folder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The person with the files installs the agent on their PC and picks folders to share. No account needed." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="580" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lg" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;White: built today&lt;br&gt;Yellow: in a GitHub issue (#number)&lt;br&gt;Red: GAP, no issue yet&lt;br&gt;Blue: data kept or email sent" style="rounded=1;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="0" width="400" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lh0" value="&lt;b&gt;Person&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lb0" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="146" width="250" height="1180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lh1" value="&lt;b&gt;Website (browser)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lb1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="146" width="250" height="1180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lh2" value="&lt;b&gt;Agent (background, on the PC)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lb2" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="146" width="250" height="1180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lh3" value="&lt;b&gt;PC settings page (browser on the PC)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0lb3" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="146" width="250" height="1180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0a" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110.0" y="181.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0b" value="Open productname.example, press Download&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#179)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="264.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0c" value="Download page: &amp;#x27;Share this PC&amp;#x27;, this system&amp;#x27;s file first&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#180)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="364.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0d" value="Run the installer. Allow the unsigned installer (macOS: Open Anyway. Windows: Run anyway). Help page explains&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#181)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25.0" y="464.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e" value="Installs, starts at every login, makes this PC&amp;#x27;s device key. Shares nothing yet" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="564.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0g" value="Settings page opens by itself when the install finishes&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#185)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="664.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0h" value="Later: open it from the Linux apps menu, the macOS menu bar (#159), the Windows tray (#160), or &amp;#x27;agent settings&amp;#x27; in a terminal" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="761.0" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0i" value="Walk to a folder, optional name, &amp;#x27;Share this folder&amp;#x27;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="864.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0j" value="Starts a file server for it on this PC only, announces the PC on the Wi-Fi" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="964.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0k" value="&amp;#x27;Shared now&amp;#x27; lists the folder, with &amp;#x27;Stop sharing&amp;#x27;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="1064.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0l" value="" style="ellipse;shape=doubleEllipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110.0" y="1181.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0a" target="p0b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0b" target="p0c"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0c" target="p0d"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0d" target="p0e"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0e" target="p0g"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0g" target="p0i"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0i" target="p0j"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0j" target="p0k"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0k" target="p0l"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0h" target="p0i"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="2 Open files on the same Wi-Fi" id="d3"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p1t" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Open files on the same Wi-Fi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Someone on the same Wi-Fi as the PC opens its shared folders. No account and no Internet needed." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="830" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lg" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;White: built today&lt;br&gt;Yellow: in a GitHub issue (#number)&lt;br&gt;Red: GAP, no issue yet&lt;br&gt;Blue: data kept or email sent" style="rounded=1;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="0" width="400" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lh0" value="&lt;b&gt;Person&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lb0" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="146" width="250" height="1680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lh1" value="&lt;b&gt;Website (browser)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lb1" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="146" width="250" height="1680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lh2" value="&lt;b&gt;App (phone or laptop)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lb2" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="146" width="250" height="1680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lh3" value="&lt;b&gt;Agent (background, on the PC)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lb3" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="146" width="250" height="1680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lh4" value="&lt;b&gt;PC settings page (browser on the PC)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="110" width="250" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1lb4" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="146" width="250" height="1680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1a" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110.0" y="181.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1b" value="Download page: &amp;#x27;Reach your PCs&amp;#x27; (APK or desktop installer)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#180)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="264.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1c" value="Install. Android asks once to allow installs from the browser&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#172)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25.0" y="364.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1d" value="Android 17+ and local network not allowed yet?" style="rhombus;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530.0" y="454.0" width="190" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e" value="Explain why, then Android asks. If refused: pick one PC from Android&amp;#x27;s own list" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="564.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1f" value="Home: look for PCs on the Wi-Fi (&amp;#x27;Looking…&amp;#x27; for up to 5 s)" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="664.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1g" value="Answers: name, device ID, shared folders, and proof of its device key" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="764.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1h" value="Proof matches the device ID?" style="rhombus;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530.0" y="854.0" width="190" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1i" value="Red card: &amp;#x27;Not the device it says it is.&amp;#x27; and the reason. Cannot open&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#174)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="964.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1i2" value="" style="ellipse;shape=doubleEllipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110.0" y="981.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1j" value="First time this app sees this PC?" style="rhombus;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530.0" y="1054.0" width="190" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1k" value="Show the fingerprint: &amp;#x27;check it matches the PC&amp;#x27;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#176)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="1164.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1k2" value="Settings page shows the same fingerprint&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#176)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1025.0" y="1164.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1l" value="Card: PC name, &amp;#x27;On your Wi-Fi&amp;#x27;, a tile per shared folder&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#174)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="1264.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1m" value="Tap a folder tile" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25.0" y="1364.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1n" value="File browser: open folders, save, send, delete" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="1464.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1n2" value="Serves the files straight to the app, encrypted" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="775.0" y="1464.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1o" value="Also coming: breadcrumbs and icons (#163), search (#164), select many (#165), transfers that keep going in the background on Android (#156)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(#163 #164 #165 #156)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="1564.0" width="200" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1p" value="" style="ellipse;shape=doubleEllipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110.0" y="1681.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1a" target="p1b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1b" target="p1c"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1c" target="p1d"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e3" value="Yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1d" target="p1e"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1e4" value="No" style="e